WEBVTT

1
00:00:09,620 --> 00:00:11,860
How does my special hot drink taste?

2
00:00:11,860 --> 00:00:15,060
Just because you want to plot against me

3
00:00:15,060 --> 00:00:17,180
There is no need to be angry with a few mad dogs

4
00:00:17,180 --> 00:00:20,460
Let's see how many days they can survive in this icy apocalypse

5
00:00:20,460 --> 00:00:28,190
I'm the director of the neighborhood committee

6
00:00:28,190 --> 00:00:29,510
Who dares to disobey

7
00:00:29,510 --> 00:00:31,020
Go and catch them

8
00:00:31,020 --> 00:00:32,140
Don't reply to me

9
00:00:32,140 --> 00:00:37,550
It's enough for you to bring me food.

10
00:00:37,550 --> 00:00:38,870
Get out of here quickly?

11
00:00:38,870 --> 00:00:40,710
He defrauded me of a box of instant noodles

12
00:00:40,710 --> 00:00:42,070
This account has not been settled yet

13
00:00:42,070 --> 00:00:43,030
it's you

14
00:00:43,030 --> 00:00:45,070
Misled us by saying that the blood disaster will end soon

15
00:00:45,070 --> 00:00:46,030
No leg supplies

16
00:00:46,030 --> 00:00:47,150
And threaten us

17
00:00:47,150 --> 00:00:48,550
You are so unkind
